{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"Y\",\n    \"concise\": \"平\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X 的大块直接交代人物的处境、原因和心理转折，单看大字更容易明白每屏在发生什么；small：Y 的非强调文字与强调词衔接更紧，能补足因果和语境，X 的感受块有时只是并列联想。core：Y 更清楚地把亲密带来的幸福、对彼此需要的期待，以及害怕失去的痛楚串成一条线；concise：两版都有跨屏回到相同担忧、同屏感受复述主句的情况，也都有不同角度的补充，难分高下；human：Y 整体表达更顺口，X 有“晃得一下失重”“念头刚安静又冒出算了但还是放不下”等具体搭配和语序问题。fine：X 的感受更多落在观众的身体和心绪上，如手不自觉收紧、喉咙发紧、肩膀松开；Y 多处转向左手、声线、颤音、琶音等音乐描写，不完全符合讲观众此刻体验的要求；load：Y 的强调词短，数量虽不少但容易扫读，X 多屏连续出现多块较长的大字，尤其 S05、S14 等屏幕，停留时间内阅读压力更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a4c80067-1c62-45fe-a850-9cb31fa3c831", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T211332649800Z", "elapsed_seconds": 169.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T21:16:21.915807+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c865e9550c5a0bfd7571f0ae7cbb2307a6fcfc8dcfc30b8f10414f48e23a1359", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1